  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.ScaleByFactor(ScalingFactor: number): boolean`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`integer llScaleByFactor(float ScalingFactor);`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Attempts to resize the entire object by <b>scaling_factor</b>, maintaining the size-position ratios of the prims.</p>
  <p>Resizing is subject to prim scale limits and linkability limits. This function can not resize the object if the linkset is physical, a pathfinding character, in a keyframed motion, or if resizing would cause the parcel to overflow.</p>
  <p>Returns a <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Integer/boolean" target="_blank">boolean</a> (an <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Integer" target="_blank">integer</a>) <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/TRUE" target="_blank">TRUE</a> if it succeeds, <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/FALSE" target="_blank">FALSE</a> if it fails.</p>
</p>
      <table class="param-table" id="parameters">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>number</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>float</span></td>
          <td>ScalingFactor / scaling_factor</td>
          <td>The multiplier to be used with the prim sizes and their local positions.</td>
        </tr>
